t":"某浇水装置可根据天气阴晴调节浇水量，晴天浇水量为阴雨天的 2.5 倍。灌满该装置的水箱后，在连续晴天的情况下可为植物自动浇水 18 天。小李 6 月 1 日 0:00 灌满水箱后，7 月 1 日 0:00 正好用完。问 6 月有多少个阴雨天？","options":[{"key":"A","text":"10"},{"key":"B","text":"16"},{"key":"C","text":"18"},{"key":"D","text":"20"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"把效率比例直接当作效率。晴天浇水量是阴雨天的 2.5 倍，可设阴雨天效率为 2、晴天效率为 5。连续晴天可用 18 天，所以水箱总量 = 18×5=90。6 月有 30 天，设阴雨天 X 天，则晴天为 30-X 天，列式：90 = 2X + 5(30-X)，解得 X=20 天。","originalExampleFingerprint":"6802a48a","declaredOriginalSource":"2016 国考","answerSourceKeys":["[\"quantity\",\"work-efficiency\",\"真题示例\"]"],"semanticAdmission":{"questionBinding":{"questionId":"notes-q-nq3-quantity-application-efficiency","questionRevision":3,"effectiveContentDigest":"6f4fd89bd073ef9ffc4b5c8863c527052c3b90f7a8f0a25efaabf6ed08ca7588"},"resolvedDependencyManifest":{"primaryTargets":[{"id":"notes-target-v4-quantity-weather-balance","revision":2,"sha256":"1d3b25ecf830923e80bad0feb3e99004947b0eecd2afa097d38f7966a55214ed"}],"supportingTargets":[],"knowledgeAtoms":[],"comparisonGroups":[],"sourceBindings":[{"subjectId":"quantity","pointId":"work-efficiency","tabId":"真题示例","revision":null,"sha256":"1784d91670d2b0d770cb765bc0bd55658b352bf62f4d5036c1f5253eb3ed2633"},{"subjectId":"quantity","pointId":"work-efficiency","tabId":"knowledge","revision":null,"sha256":"241b405146e9a58d8db8cc5ba0b871fa607fae335008b8dd39c9ff21fa9c254d"}],"sourceAnchors":[],"originalExample":{"subjectId":"quantity","pointId":"work-efficiency","tabId":"真题示例","expectedBlockSha256":"8e13ab7ffe9c0ea5d28462a0c33bf7bd92dde6612ff59a0a76a4fca45edf307e","revision":null},"materialGroup":null,"images":[],"sharedSourceBindings":[]},"dependencyDigest":"3703a00c75a7105e9eea251a4d335284cef3a0768def17f85faef2fd508af67e","ruleVersion":"exam-goal-v4","ruleDigest":"cde4b0cf5c8f1542a5a662cc642037c39b9968aba1618b319d56fd8b62cb8033","receiptId":"work-source-independent-notes-q-nq3-quantity-application-efficiency-r3","signatureVersion":"notes-semantic-v1","signature":"72587ef2716fcdeee47f98b87cab6e1bec6a9187e1